WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.950
I'm back.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.720
Chiaki, coming to greet me when I return, I'm really happy.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.760
Kana! Bad news.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.680
Hey Kana, Haruka-neesama looks really troubled.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.390
Really?

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:08.190
Now then, what did you do this time?

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.300
Now, apologise!

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:13.460
Oh shut up! Even Haruka has problems of her own.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.840
Let her fret.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.820
Why you...

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.040
She could be fretting over what to cook for dinner.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.110
But...

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.710
Don't get so anxious.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.920
Yeah...

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:45.690
Let us partake.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:47.840
I was wrong?

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.000
You were wrong, idiot!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.720
It could be about what's for breakfast.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:02.030
This time it better not be wrong.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:16.370
Wrong again...

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:24.520
The truth is that you did something to make her worry, right?

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.580
What did you say?

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:30.560
Which peerless genius do you think you are talking to, you idiot?

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.440
When class ends, I'll come find you.

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.060
We'll discuss then.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.960
Ok. Let's do that.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:02:59.900
Hey!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.040
You're late, idiot.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.280
Sorry.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:09.710
Let's get going?

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:10.860
Ok.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:37.690
It seems like Chiaki has something important to do, telling us to go ahead first.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.150
Really...?

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.640
And Kana isn't back...

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.140
Here.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.860
Thanks.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.810
Haruka-chan, what's the matter?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.160
I have a small cavity.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.520
Cavity?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:58.850
Oh I see, cause you have a troubled look.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.760
Well, I do have some problems.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:02.630
Will you hear me out?

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.300
Kana and Chiaki seem unusual...

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:12.140
Did Chiaki say anything at school?

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.980
I didn't hear anything special.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.920
She wasn't smiling at all.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.290
And she would have a weird expression on her face at times.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.940
Could it be because she is playing the staring game?

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.990
Haruka-chan should try to make her smile or something?

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:33.240
Eh? But what kind of face should I show?

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:37.210
Like, this.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.200
What?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.410
I'm back.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.050
I have returned.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.330
Stop it...

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.160
Kana...

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.490
Haruka-neesama doesn't want us anymore!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:14.260
It looks like she wants sisters like Uchida and Yoshino.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.100
That's not true.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.350
Haruka is trying to challenge us to a "staring game."

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.760
Since yesterday.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:36.190
No... It's not possible.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:37.800
Alright.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.810
Oh my, welcome back, you two.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.570
Come, let's play the staring game!

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.770
Let's go!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.170
Why the staring game?

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.710
Ah!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.680
Morning.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.470
Good morning.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.810
Morning.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:08.260
What's the matter?

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:14.480
This is... it seems she dreamt I went shopping and didn't return.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.870
It was like a sad dream.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:29.440
But, once in a while, days like these are nice.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.420
The feeling of you two getting along.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.580
Even if you say that...

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:38.010
It's no joke listening to her arrogance at such a close distance.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.310
Hey Kana, feed me.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.350
I can't feed myself like this, right?

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:47.560
If you let go, you can eat.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:52.100
I'm talking about how I can't feed myself while maintaining this position.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.520
Talking with idiots frustrates me.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.660
What are you doing, idiot?

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.830
Haruka, is it okay not to get angry?

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:07.060
We're showing no etiquette at the table.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:11.000
But, it's fine once in a while.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.800
I'll be back in the evening.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.810
Haruka, hurry up!

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:22.970
We're borrowing Haruka for a while.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.180
Alright.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.570
Have a safe trip.

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:27.890
Have a safe trip, Haruka.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:29.610
I'm going!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.210
Where are we going first?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.980
Haruka, is there anything you want to get?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.610
Let me see...

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.660
This product only costs...

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.440
Mix it like this...

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.840
What's this... There's nothing on.
Mix it like this...

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.360
What's this... There's nothing on.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:07.610
Since it's a precious day off, I should go out.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:10.600
You are an idiot, so don't go out.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:18.970
I'll take a nap then.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.300
What's the matter?

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:24.550
I'm back.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.630
Sorry I'm a little late.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.990
I see you're still at it.

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:36.700
What's the matter?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.040
Wait, Kana?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.780
Kana, what's the matter?

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:51.220
Chiaki, did something happen?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:57.850
It seems she dreamt that Haruka-neesama went to the toilet and didn't return.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.750
Haruka!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:06.150
Haruka!

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:16.810
See you tomorrow.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.000
Alright.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.370
See you again.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:20.610
Be careful.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.420
Oh yeah, I forgot.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.830
Kana-chan.

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:28.870
Here.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.880
Kana-chan, write one.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.660
What is that?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.840
Tanabata wish paper, put it with us at our school.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.710
Ok.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:47.520
It's fine not to write an interesting dream.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:50.230
That's... Nope, I can't think of anything good.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:57.110
Oh... Speaking of which, recently...

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:00.440
Don't look.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.940
Why?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.710
I said don't look!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.370
Why?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.140
Ok.

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:15.360
Here. Don't look. It's a bit embarrassing.

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.090
Why?

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:20.710
I'll send them off and head to the convenience store.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.290
Please do, Kana.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.610
Be careful.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:27.000
Yeah.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:38.020
Erm... The things to buy are... Milk, plain bread and snacks.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.450
We don't need snacks.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.010
Milk and sweetened bread!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.600
It's plain bread, don't get it mixed up with snacks.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.620
I get it, I'm going.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.560
Sorry to have intruded.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.240
She is such a noisy fellow.

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.830
That's Kana for you.

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.630
Kana is sure late.

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:15.480
Yeah.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:20.260
Where did Kana go off to? Hmm?

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.980
H-Haruka-neesama

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.280
What's the matter, Chiaki?

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.820
Th-this.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.350
What is it?

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:45.890
A note?

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.040
It's a joke, right?

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:55.270
Y-yeah... That's Kana for you.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.570
Yeah...

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:57.840
Yep.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.120
Kana...

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.700
Milk, plain bread and snacks...

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.150
We don't need snacks.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.600
Milk and sweetened bread!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.870
It's plain bread, don't get it mixed up with snacks.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:31.590
If it was just about the snacks, I should have let her buy it.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.470
Eh? I don't think it's because of that...

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:41.080
I get it, I'm going.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.020
Sorry for the intrusion.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:51.800
K-Kana.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:55.820
She didn't really go right? Ah!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:02.660
I've had enough of this!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:07.320
You always say "idiot" in every other sentence.

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:11.680
It's stabbing at my heart, I can't take it anymore!

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.420
I can't talk properly with you anymore!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.650
Haruka-neesama

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:22.150
It could be my fault.

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.440
No... It's my fault.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:25.750
But...

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:31.460
She wrote it so earnestly.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.350
Then why is it Chiaki's fault?

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:40.230
Kana...

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.890
Oh, Chiaki?

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:50.470
Chiaki, you're going to catch a cold sleeping like that.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.120
Hey, Kana!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.660
Haruka! It's really delicious!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.420
It should be done soon.

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:33.330
It's cute!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:35.590
Hey, what are you doing?

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.580
This is a creation I'm proud of!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.040
I wonder if it suits your tastes, Princess.

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:49.760
What are you doing?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.480
What are you doing, Chiaki?

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.120
Kana.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:00.930
Haruka-neesama.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:05.280
I knew it. It was about snacks... If I had just let her have them...

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:07.840
If we go look for her right now...

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:14.670
Yeah... I'll go look for her. Chiaki, go buy some snacks.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.560
Yes! Haruka-neesama.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.670
I'm back.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:28.980
Sorry for the wait, I bought the milk and plain bread.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:32.770
I walked so much... Milk was sold out in many places...

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.920
Eh? Eh?

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:42.390
Eh?

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.370
Well, how do I put it?

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.960
Something like that is just like Kana-chan.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.000
But..

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:00.300
On the Tanabata wish paper, there's the words meat and sea urchins...

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.880
What's with that?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.670
That's really like her.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:06.330
This was the paper I gave you yesterday, huh.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:21.360
The fat around my stomach has recently...

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.610
It's really embarrassing.

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:30.830
Sorry to have made you two worry.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.360
Then everyone, let's have some snacks.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.990
It looks like Kana doesn't want any snacks.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.240
I want to eat! I want to eat! You guys are mean!

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:58.590
Ok, let's begin then.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:01.260
I've been waiting for this Tanabata party!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.760
It is time for my debut!

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.570
You don't need to be so overly energetic.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.660
What did you say?

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:07.420
What is with that?

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:08.910
I am not like that!

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:18.060
It's amazing.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.200
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:19.920
Yep.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.830
We're lucky we got clear weather.

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:28.580
Orihime and Otohime should be meeting right around now.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:31.170
It's not Otohime, but Hikoboshi, isn't it?

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.790
Uchida, how many times have I said it?

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.390
That princes are works of fiction.

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:41.710
Give me a break!

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:49.510
Kana, hurry up!

00:22:49.510 --> 00:22:50.730
We'll leave you behind...

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:52.050
Wait wait!

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:57.660
Ok!

00:22:58.610 --> 00:22:59.980
Sorry for the wait!

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:03.000
Hurry!

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:05.250
We are heading out!

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:29.360
I just dreamt that I couldn't see Haruka anymore.
